  dimensions       = {true},
  abstract         = {H2M is a computational framework that models human genetic variants in the mouse
                      genome, predicting murine equivalents that mirror the sequence and functional
                      consequences of human variants. H2M supports mouse-to-human and paralog-to-paralog
